; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
; Story_EndDrawBgRow
;
; Draw the next background row (Title_DrawBgRow); go on to the attributes
; if it asked for them, else back to Story_RedrawLogoRow.  Leaves sceneStep
; at 5 (Story_End).
